### Ask about today's match (triggers resolve_time -> get_fixtures -> get_events)
POST http://localhost:8080/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Who scored for United today?"
}

###

### Ask about lineup
POST http://localhost:8080/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Who started at right-back in United's last match?"
}

###

### Historical question (triggers search_knowledge_base)
POST http://localhost:8080/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Tell me about the 1999 Treble"
}

###

### Player bio (triggers search_knowledge_base with player_bio filter)
POST http://localhost:8080/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Who is Eric Cantona?"
}

###

### No match scenario
POST http://localhost:8080/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What was United's formation in yesterday's match?"
}
